WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
03:08.560 --> 03:10.680
Good. At least you understand that I have power.

4
03:10.760 --> 03:11.880
You're fired.

5
03:11.960 --> 03:13.280
PREVIOUSLY

6
03:13.360 --> 03:14.760
Then what do you want me to do?

7
03:14.840 --> 03:16.840
Go back to the construction site.

8
03:16.920 --> 03:18.160
You have to stay here.

9
03:19.560 --> 03:22.040
Everything your mom owns belongs to me.

10
03:22.120 --> 03:23.520
Even her life

11
03:23.600 --> 03:25.520
and every breath she takes.

12
03:25.600 --> 03:28.720
Chayanee ordered Hathaya to work overtime. Go help her.

13
03:33.240 --> 03:34.240
Hey.

14
03:35.360 --> 03:38.960
You worked all day and all night. You should rest today.

15
03:39.560 --> 03:40.800
I can't.

16
03:40.880 --> 03:44.240
Chayanee won't allow it. She'll just find an excuse to give us a hard time.

17
03:44.840 --> 03:47.720
Don't force yourself if you can't take it. I'm worried about you.

18
03:53.640 --> 03:56.120
Well, now that you're done here, where are you going?

19
03:57.520 --> 03:59.280
I need to find a job.

20
04:00.080 --> 04:03.560
I have to save money so I can take my mom away and live with her.

21
04:04.320 --> 04:08.960
Your father is doing well for himself now.

22
04:09.040 --> 04:11.080
You could ask him for help.

23
04:14.000 --> 04:18.079
I don't want to depend on him. And don't bring him up again. Understand?

24
04:21.200 --> 04:24.720
Besides, I have a good resume. I'll find something.

25
04:26.400 --> 04:28.400
Good luck. I know you can do it.

26
04:29.120 --> 04:31.960
You too. Hang in there.

27
04:36.040 --> 04:36.920
What?

28
04:37.000 --> 04:39.280
-Your hand. -What for?

29
04:42.200 --> 04:43.280
Hang in there.

30
04:47.080 --> 04:48.160
You too.

31
05:10.000 --> 05:13.320
FOREMAN WANTED

32
05:31.760 --> 05:32.800
Hello.

33
05:34.000 --> 05:35.480
Hello, Uncle.

34
05:35.560 --> 05:37.120
Where's Ramil?

35
05:39.320 --> 05:41.040
I want to see him.

36
05:43.280 --> 05:46.760
Someone told me he quit. How is that possible?

37
05:46.840 --> 05:50.240
Mr. Pichai cares about Ramil. There's no way he would fire him.

38
05:50.320 --> 05:51.440
What happened?

39
05:53.800 --> 05:55.400
Well…

40
06:06.640 --> 06:10.400
All I had to do was tell people to blacklist you. No one will hire you.

41
06:13.880 --> 06:16.200
But if I send a message asking them to give you a job,

42
06:16.840 --> 06:18.400
they'll change their minds.

43
06:23.040 --> 06:25.240
I don't need anyone's help.

44
06:28.880 --> 06:30.280
Come on.

45
06:30.360 --> 06:34.160
Weren't you planning to take your mom away and start a new life?

46
06:34.240 --> 06:35.680
You need money.

47
06:37.760 --> 06:39.800
Stop worrying so much about your pride.

48
06:43.240 --> 06:44.400
What do you want?

49
06:49.080 --> 06:50.160
Get down and beg me.

50
06:53.560 --> 06:57.880
What dignity do you even have? Your father abandoned you when you were growing up.

51
06:59.600 --> 07:00.880
My father took pity

52
07:01.560 --> 07:04.360
on you and your mother and let you live under our roof.

53
07:05.560 --> 07:08.720
You were like a couple of stray dogs.

54
07:10.560 --> 07:12.680
You have no dignity, Ramil.

55
07:13.480 --> 07:16.520
You're worthless. You're a parasite.

56
07:18.880 --> 07:21.560
Go on. Get down on your knees.

57
07:36.560 --> 07:38.520
Ramil, don't.

58
07:38.600 --> 07:41.600
You don't have to kneel to anyone. I'll help you.

59
07:42.200 --> 07:44.120
Back off. It's none of your business.

60
08:17.160 --> 08:18.000
Bow down.

61
08:21.400 --> 08:22.640
Bow to me.

62
08:35.200 --> 08:37.400
I knelt and paid my respects to you

63
08:38.240 --> 08:39.640
as a way of thanking you

64
08:40.799 --> 08:42.760
for the help you gave me when we were children.

65
08:42.840 --> 08:45.080
But from now on,

66
08:46.280 --> 08:48.080
we owe each other nothing.

67
08:51.680 --> 08:53.040
And to be perfectly clear,

68
08:54.360 --> 08:55.800
someone like you…

69
08:57.480 --> 08:58.960
isn't worth bowing to.

70
09:02.840 --> 09:04.680
But if you want me to bow to you that badly,

71
09:05.840 --> 09:06.880
wait a little longer.

72
09:08.400 --> 09:10.000
I'll do it…

73
09:12.040 --> 09:13.840
at your funeral.

74
09:15.120 --> 09:16.120
Ramil.

75
09:17.720 --> 09:19.920
So you're declaring yourself my enemy?

76
09:21.760 --> 09:25.960
Just wait. I'll destroy your life.

77
09:46.000 --> 09:48.440
Ramil. I need to talk to you.

78
09:51.240 --> 09:54.240
We already talked. Stay away from me.

79
09:56.440 --> 09:59.600
I know you were fired and you're looking for work.

80
10:00.480 --> 10:02.360
I'm doing well for myself now.

81
10:03.360 --> 10:06.200
You don't need to work for anyone else. I'll invest in you.

82
10:06.280 --> 10:07.560
Start your own development.

83
10:10.200 --> 10:12.760
Why won't you accept that I'm trying to help?

84
10:14.400 --> 10:16.720
I told you already. I don't have a father.

85
10:18.760 --> 10:21.920
And from childhood until now,

86
10:22.000 --> 10:23.520
I've survived on my own.

87
10:24.080 --> 10:26.800
I don't need to depend on you. I can live without you.

88
10:28.120 --> 10:30.680
I know I was wrong. I won't make excuses.

89
10:32.760 --> 10:34.960
If you never forgive me, I can accept that.

90
10:37.800 --> 10:39.200
Then what do you want?

91
10:40.240 --> 10:44.240
Don't cut me out of your life. Let me be your father.

92
11:06.040 --> 11:07.080
Where are you going?

93
11:10.160 --> 11:11.760
I'm moving out.

94
11:15.120 --> 11:15.960
Put that away.

95
11:17.040 --> 11:19.520
I'm going to find somewhere to rent. I don't want to be a burden anymore.

96
11:21.440 --> 11:23.480
I told you to put it away.

97
11:24.880 --> 11:26.080
I've said what I needed to.

98
11:28.040 --> 11:29.440
Enough.

99
11:30.040 --> 11:32.040
Let me see.

100
11:33.040 --> 11:35.320
You don't need any of it.

101
11:35.400 --> 11:38.360
Take everything out.

102
11:39.720 --> 11:41.960
Pick everything up and go back upstairs.

103
11:42.040 --> 11:45.000
They're only clothes. I can buy new ones.

104
11:49.080 --> 11:52.880
Why do you want to keep me here? You've never valued me.

105
11:53.960 --> 11:57.280
I want to be treated like a person. I don't want to be your obedient pet.

106
11:58.000 --> 12:00.520
I asked you before whether you ever loved me.

107
12:00.600 --> 12:02.920
You couldn't answer because you never loved me.

108
12:03.520 --> 12:05.360
You only wanted to use me.

109
12:05.440 --> 12:09.000
You brought me here because you needed someone to raise your son

110
12:09.080 --> 12:11.000
and take care of everything in the house.

111
12:11.080 --> 12:13.280
You wanted a housekeeper, not a wife.

112
12:14.640 --> 12:17.320
And you already promised me.

113
12:17.400 --> 12:19.560
You said if I gave you my assets,

114
12:19.640 --> 12:22.000
you would let me go. Please.

115
12:22.080 --> 12:25.280
Sanguansri. Come back. Come back!

116
12:25.360 --> 12:26.920
I said come back.

117
12:28.080 --> 12:29.080
Sanguansri.

118
12:29.160 --> 12:31.480
You don't have the right to do whatever you want.

119
12:31.560 --> 12:33.720
I'm the only one who decides whether you stay or go.

120
12:33.800 --> 12:36.080
Get back inside.

121
12:36.160 --> 12:38.600
I'm not staying. I don't want to be your pet anymore.

122
12:39.520 --> 12:41.720
Oh, really? I told you to go back--

123
12:41.800 --> 12:42.680
-No! -Stop, Saksit!

124
12:44.320 --> 12:45.560
Hey.

125
12:47.720 --> 12:51.000
What the hell does this have to do with you? You drove onto my property.

126
12:51.080 --> 12:53.200
You're trespassing. Get out.

127
12:53.280 --> 12:55.920
I'm not leaving until this is settled.

128
12:56.600 --> 12:58.120
Fine. Raiwin.

129
12:58.200 --> 13:01.640
Call the police and have them drag him out of here.

130
13:04.440 --> 13:05.840
I came here to talk.

131
13:06.840 --> 13:09.920
You and Sanguansri aren't happy together. Why keep forcing this?

132
13:11.440 --> 13:12.960
I came to take her away with me.

133
13:13.040 --> 13:16.200
You're despicable. You abandoned your wife and son.

134
13:16.280 --> 13:19.160
I took them in and supported them for years.

135
13:19.240 --> 13:20.600
You know how much money I spent?

136
13:20.680 --> 13:23.240
Now you have the nerve to ask for your wife back?

137
13:24.360 --> 13:25.480
How much do you want?

138
13:25.560 --> 13:27.120
Now that's how I like it.

139
13:28.200 --> 13:31.000
This is how a rich man should talk.

140
13:31.680 --> 13:34.920
How much do you want to divorce Sanguansri?

141
13:37.480 --> 13:40.120
Twenty million.

142
13:40.200 --> 13:43.400
You already took her money and her property. That still isn't enough?

143
13:45.760 --> 13:50.360
I'll give you ten million. Refuse, and I'll have a lawyer file for divorce.

144
13:50.440 --> 13:52.200
This case won't be difficult to win.

145
13:53.280 --> 13:56.640
You've been abusing her all along.

146
13:57.760 --> 14:01.360
Your choice. Ten million, or not a single baht.

147
14:06.480 --> 14:07.440
Tomorrow.

148
14:09.160 --> 14:10.560
Bring me the money.

149
14:13.120 --> 14:14.960
Then you can take your wife back.

150
14:18.440 --> 14:20.040
I need to speak to her privately.

151
14:22.680 --> 14:24.160
Privately?

152
14:25.800 --> 14:28.200
Fine. Talk privately.

153
14:42.680 --> 14:43.920
Are you hurt?

154
14:46.200 --> 14:47.320
No. I'm fine.

155
14:50.360 --> 14:52.280
But you shouldn't get into trouble for me.

156
14:54.240 --> 14:55.680
Don't think like that.

157
14:56.360 --> 14:58.920
I need to make up for abandoning you and our son.

158
15:00.400 --> 15:02.440
But where are you going to get the money?

159
15:03.240 --> 15:06.640
I told you. The business I started with my friend is doing well.

160
15:07.720 --> 15:09.880
I have enough now to help you

161
15:10.680 --> 15:12.240
start a new life.

162
15:16.560 --> 15:20.240
You don't have to forgive me. You don't even have to love me again.

163
15:21.680 --> 15:24.320
I just want you and our son to live comfortably.

164
15:25.440 --> 15:27.000
I'll come back for you tomorrow.

165
15:36.000 --> 15:37.800
I'll be waiting.

166
15:50.480 --> 15:51.920
You're the one

167
15:52.000 --> 15:54.200
who told him about me, weren't you?

168
15:56.040 --> 16:00.840
Mr. Anon is very worried about you. And he's proven that he can change.

169
16:00.920 --> 16:05.400
He has a stable career now. I want you to forgive your father.

170
16:08.640 --> 16:09.480
No.

171
16:10.920 --> 16:11.920
I've been hurt

172
16:12.880 --> 16:14.200
too badly to forgive him.

173
16:15.280 --> 16:16.600
And I'm scared…

174
16:18.200 --> 16:19.640
that I'll get hurt all over again.

175
16:22.280 --> 16:23.960
It's better if he stays out of our lives.

176
16:26.120 --> 16:27.400
And one more thing.

177
16:29.360 --> 16:31.080
Don't help him either.

178
16:45.120 --> 16:46.280
Hathaya.

179
16:48.600 --> 16:49.800
Promise me.

180
16:52.240 --> 16:53.120
Okay.

181
17:12.000 --> 17:13.440
It's Ramil's dad.

182
17:15.560 --> 17:17.599
Can we talk tomorrow?

183
17:28.920 --> 17:31.840
Hello, Uncle.

184
17:32.360 --> 17:34.560
Were you just at the development?

185
17:35.160 --> 17:39.360
I had something to take care of. Ramil won't answer my calls. Where is he?

186
17:40.240 --> 17:44.040
Actually, Ramil already got upset with me

187
17:44.120 --> 17:45.840
for telling you what happened.

188
17:48.680 --> 17:51.440
I'm sorry I got you into trouble too.

189
17:52.920 --> 17:56.000
But this is important. I need to see Ramil.

190
18:00.960 --> 18:04.920
I'm going to give Saksit money to buy Sanguansri's freedom.

191
18:06.880 --> 18:09.320
I want Ramil with me to bring his mom home.

192
18:10.080 --> 18:13.120
She'll be so happy if he comes with me.

193
18:16.640 --> 18:18.040
Can you help me one more time?

194
18:35.360 --> 18:38.000
Hello, Ramil.

195
18:38.600 --> 18:42.040
I'm going out at noon to buy some things for the workers.

196
18:42.120 --> 18:43.720
Can you come meet me?

197
18:45.560 --> 18:48.320
Okay. Yes.

198
18:52.680 --> 18:54.800
I arranged for Ramil to meet you.

199
18:57.760 --> 19:00.800
Thank you so much. Truly.

200
19:01.440 --> 19:04.200
Today is going to be the happiest day of my life.

201
19:04.280 --> 19:06.680
We'll finally be together as a family.

202
19:07.600 --> 19:08.720
Yes.

203
19:09.240 --> 19:10.680
Thank you.

204
19:22.080 --> 19:24.200
I'm here. Where are you?

205
19:24.880 --> 19:25.720
Ramil.

206
19:33.200 --> 19:35.560
What do you need? I'll help you pick it out.

207
19:51.000 --> 19:52.000
You.

208
19:55.360 --> 19:59.560
Your father has something important he needs to talk to you about.

209
20:00.480 --> 20:01.960
Why did you do this?

210
20:03.200 --> 20:06.440
I trusted you, but you lied to me.

211
20:06.520 --> 20:09.880
I'm sorry I broke my promise.

212
20:10.760 --> 20:13.040
Please listen to me first. Your father has something--

213
20:13.120 --> 20:14.800
I told you already.

214
20:14.880 --> 20:17.880
I don't have a father. My father is dead.

215
20:20.680 --> 20:23.000
Ramil, wait.

216
20:27.560 --> 20:28.680
Uncle.

217
20:28.760 --> 20:31.760
Please wait here. I'll go talk to Ramil.

218
20:31.840 --> 20:32.720
Hey.

219
20:34.360 --> 20:38.080
Enough. You've already done so much to help me.

220
20:38.960 --> 20:41.080
I don't want Ramil getting even angrier with you.

221
20:42.280 --> 20:45.040
I want Ramil to go with you.

222
20:46.320 --> 20:49.920
It's almost time for my appointment. I need to settle things with Saksit.

223
20:52.640 --> 20:56.320
If I can get his mom out of there, maybe Ramil will forgive me.

224
20:57.640 --> 20:59.600
I'm rooting for you.

225
21:00.880 --> 21:02.200
Thank you so much.

226
21:02.880 --> 21:04.040
Take care, Uncle.

227
21:14.000 --> 21:16.000
Wow.

228
21:17.160 --> 21:20.000
What are you standing there for?

229
21:20.080 --> 21:22.880
Take her suitcase outside.

230
21:23.480 --> 21:27.120
Sanguansri's husband is coming to pick her up.

231
21:27.800 --> 21:31.080
She can't wait to get out of this house.

232
21:31.960 --> 21:33.760
Your boss

233
21:33.840 --> 21:36.360
is dying to get out of here.

234
21:37.600 --> 21:42.000
You look beautiful today.

235
21:44.040 --> 21:46.880
You must be desperate to see your old husband again.

236
21:47.640 --> 21:49.640
I just want to live with my son.

237
21:49.720 --> 21:51.640
I want us to have a life together.

238
21:52.240 --> 21:55.920
What time are you meeting Anon?

239
21:59.480 --> 22:00.960
It's almost time.

240
22:01.920 --> 22:05.480
Raiwin, come out with me.

241
22:07.000 --> 22:08.400
Where are you going?

242
22:09.440 --> 22:11.840
I arranged to collect the money somewhere else.

243
22:12.400 --> 22:13.880
Once I have it,

244
22:15.000 --> 22:16.480
I'll let him come pick you up.

245
22:17.280 --> 22:20.320
Why not meet him here? Then once it's settled, I can leave.

246
22:22.480 --> 22:24.360
You hate looking at me that much?

247
22:25.880 --> 22:28.360
You can't wait to get away from me?

248
22:28.440 --> 22:31.200
Let me tell you something. I arranged for my lawyer

249
22:31.280 --> 22:33.480
to prepare written documents.

250
22:33.560 --> 22:36.840
My lawyer is sick. I don't want to waste time,

251
22:37.560 --> 22:39.080
so I'm meeting him at his house.

252
22:39.160 --> 22:42.320
And I told your ex-husband to meet us there too.

253
22:45.520 --> 22:46.560
Look.

254
22:49.960 --> 22:54.280
I had your favorite food prepared. Have it before you go.

255
22:55.560 --> 22:57.640
Enjoy.

256
22:57.720 --> 23:00.520
Eat plenty. Drink lots of water too.

257
23:01.360 --> 23:02.600
In case you shed some tears.

258
23:04.400 --> 23:05.960
Oh.

259
23:06.840 --> 23:10.200
I'm just happy for you. I imagine you'll be crying with joy

260
23:13.320 --> 23:15.320
once you finally get out of this house.

261
23:33.960 --> 23:35.200
Hello.

262
23:35.280 --> 23:36.680
I'm heading out now.

263
23:38.680 --> 23:40.680
Make sure your money is ready.

264
23:40.760 --> 23:42.560
I have the full amount.

265
23:43.480 --> 23:45.240
Once the papers are signed, I'll get her.

266
23:48.240 --> 23:49.480
Come on, Raiwin.

267
24:01.960 --> 24:05.240
Ramil, wait. Wait.

268
24:07.960 --> 24:09.920
I know you're upset.

269
24:10.960 --> 24:13.080
I broke your trust.

270
24:15.080 --> 24:17.760
But I just don't want you to regret things the way I do.

271
24:22.960 --> 24:24.560
I don't have a father.

272
24:26.160 --> 24:28.240
The grandmother I loved is gone.

273
24:29.840 --> 24:31.800
My mother only keeps creating problems.

274
24:33.680 --> 24:35.240
I have no one left.

275
24:37.800 --> 24:39.400
But you still have them.

276
24:42.040 --> 24:46.040
Your father is trying to change himself for his family.

277
24:47.480 --> 24:49.800
He wants you to be proud of him just once.

278
24:55.000 --> 24:56.600
I know I was wrong.

279
24:58.760 --> 25:02.680
I only wanted all of you to be together again.

280
25:07.640 --> 25:12.120
Father, mother, and son.

281
25:14.760 --> 25:16.360
I lied…

282
25:18.200 --> 25:20.000
because I wanted to see you happy.

283
25:20.760 --> 25:24.120
But I'm happier without him.

284
25:24.200 --> 25:25.880
But you're talking about your father.

285
25:28.480 --> 25:30.640
He worked to get the money

286
25:30.720 --> 25:32.880
to buy your mother's freedom.

287
25:36.040 --> 25:37.760
He wanted you to go with him.

288
25:39.760 --> 25:42.600
He wanted you to be the one to bring your mother out of that house.

289
25:45.000 --> 25:47.640
So she could be proud of you.

290
25:53.680 --> 25:56.760
I know he's disappointed and hurt you more times than you can count.

291
25:58.680 --> 26:01.000
But can you give your father one more chance…

292
26:03.720 --> 26:05.800
before it's too late?

293
26:20.240 --> 26:21.440
I'm going to get my mom.

294
26:57.240 --> 27:00.400
Dad, your lawyer's house isn't this way.

295
27:01.600 --> 27:04.680
Who told you I was going to my lawyer's house?

296
27:05.440 --> 27:07.680
Then where are you meeting Ramil's dad?

297
27:14.480 --> 27:16.960
Dad, what are you doing?

298
27:35.480 --> 27:36.480
Mom.

299
27:38.880 --> 27:41.760
-Where are they? -They went out.

300
27:42.880 --> 27:45.480
Wasn't Uncle Anon supposed to bring the money here?

301
27:46.080 --> 27:48.640
Mr. Saksit said they'd settle everything at the lawyer's.

302
27:48.720 --> 27:51.480
He said once it was finished, Anon would come here to get me.

303
27:52.320 --> 27:54.640
Then why did they need to meet somewhere else?

304
27:54.720 --> 27:58.080
Ramil, I have a bad feeling. I want to go find your father.

305
27:59.080 --> 28:02.720
I'll call Uncle Anon and ask where he is.

306
28:07.840 --> 28:09.080
Hello, dear.

307
28:09.160 --> 28:10.280
Hello, Uncle.

308
28:11.400 --> 28:15.240
Where are you meeting Mr. Saksit? Could you share your location with me?

309
28:15.320 --> 28:17.200
Is something wrong?

310
28:18.080 --> 28:19.200
So…

311
28:20.360 --> 28:22.280
Ramil is going with you.

312
28:23.080 --> 28:25.680
And he wants to bring Aunt Sanguansri too.

313
28:25.760 --> 28:28.320
Once everything is settled, all of you can leave together.

314
28:31.720 --> 28:34.480
We're finally going to be together as a family?

315
28:35.720 --> 28:37.200
Thank you so much.

316
28:50.600 --> 28:52.120
He sent the location.

317
29:07.040 --> 29:09.800
I want a big house. Several bedrooms.

318
29:09.880 --> 29:13.280
That way, when my son has a family, there'll be room for my grandchildren.

319
29:17.280 --> 29:18.360
Soon,

320
29:19.400 --> 29:21.560
we'll all be together.

321
29:22.760 --> 29:24.160
Father, mother, and son.

322
29:51.240 --> 29:53.840
Why did you stop?

323
29:53.920 --> 29:55.600
Go. Follow him.

324
29:57.480 --> 29:59.680
Dad, do you even realize what you're doing?

325
29:59.760 --> 30:03.040
Of course. I'm not going to be humiliated. If he takes my woman,

326
30:03.120 --> 30:06.560
I'll kill him, take his cash, and keep his woman working for me.

327
30:07.160 --> 30:10.320
You're trying to kill someone. You could get the death penalty.

328
30:10.400 --> 30:12.680
I know. Stop talking. Follow him.

329
30:12.760 --> 30:14.400
Hurry.

330
30:14.480 --> 30:16.000
No. Enough.

331
30:16.080 --> 30:18.520
How can I stop now? He saw my face.

332
30:18.600 --> 30:20.280
He knows I shot him.

333
30:21.200 --> 30:23.160
If he survives, he'll come after us.

334
30:23.240 --> 30:26.320
You and I will both become suspects and go to prison.

335
30:26.400 --> 30:29.280
And you'll be charged as my accomplice.

336
30:29.360 --> 30:31.560
Go. Hurry.

337
30:56.760 --> 30:57.720
Dad.

338
30:58.680 --> 31:02.520
He's dead. Let's go. Someone could see us.

339
31:02.600 --> 31:04.000
-Come on. -Wait.

340
31:05.760 --> 31:07.880
Dad, what are you doing?

341
31:09.360 --> 31:10.400
Dad.

342
31:18.280 --> 31:21.120
-He's still alive. -You bastards.

343
31:25.320 --> 31:27.840
Help. Help me.

344
31:33.960 --> 31:36.080
Kill him.

345
31:36.680 --> 31:37.560
Shoot him.

346
31:38.880 --> 31:39.720
No.

347
31:44.000 --> 31:45.520
I can't do it, Dad.

348
31:46.320 --> 31:48.320
Please don't make me.

349
31:48.400 --> 31:49.680
Make you?

350
31:50.240 --> 31:51.120
Hey.

351
31:51.720 --> 31:53.520
You want me to kill you too?

352
31:55.000 --> 31:56.120
Dad.

353
31:57.560 --> 31:59.600
I'm your son.

354
32:00.200 --> 32:02.800
You're my son. And I'd still kill you

355
32:03.520 --> 32:05.280
if you betrayed me.

356
32:06.480 --> 32:09.680
If you want the money, take it.

357
32:10.880 --> 32:13.480
Just let me go. I…

358
32:14.640 --> 32:16.760
I only want to live with my wife and son.

359
32:17.520 --> 32:18.760
Your wife?

360
32:19.760 --> 32:21.720
Kill him. Now!

361
32:22.600 --> 32:25.160
Someone like you isn't worth bowing to.

362
32:26.680 --> 32:28.120
But if you want me to bow to you that badly,

363
32:29.120 --> 32:30.520
I'll do it…

364
32:33.200 --> 32:34.640
at your funeral.

365
32:51.240 --> 32:53.880
Hey. What are you standing there for?

366
32:53.960 --> 32:56.720
Move. Someone could come. Drive.

367
32:58.080 --> 32:59.320
Hurry. Get in.

368
33:03.040 --> 33:05.240
Hurry. Go.

369
33:22.440 --> 33:23.880
That's Uncle Anon's car.

370
33:27.200 --> 33:28.320
Anon.

371
33:37.960 --> 33:38.920
Ramil.

372
33:41.280 --> 33:43.040
-Dad. -Uncle.

373
33:43.120 --> 33:45.120
Anon.

374
33:45.200 --> 33:47.000
What happened?

375
33:47.520 --> 33:49.360
I'm sorry.

376
33:52.840 --> 33:55.040
I couldn't buy your freedom.

377
33:56.760 --> 33:58.960
What happened?

378
34:02.480 --> 34:04.360
They took the money.

379
34:18.320 --> 34:19.480
I'm so happy

380
34:20.719 --> 34:22.199
you came to see me, son.

381
34:32.400 --> 34:34.920
I bought you a house.

382
34:36.159 --> 34:37.320
I finally bought it.

383
34:47.360 --> 34:49.000
I sold our house before.

384
34:50.760 --> 34:52.400
I hurt you so badly.

385
34:55.920 --> 34:57.440
Let me make it right, son.

386
35:01.000 --> 35:03.240
I bought a big house…

387
35:05.560 --> 35:07.360
so you can live there with your mom.

388
35:14.280 --> 35:16.800
I chose one with many bedrooms too.

389
35:19.440 --> 35:20.880
When you have a family…

390
35:23.200 --> 35:25.520
there'll be room for the grandchildren.

391
35:38.760 --> 35:40.520
If you can forgive me…

392
35:48.000 --> 35:51.240
please let me come visit you and your mom sometimes.

393
35:53.640 --> 35:54.560
No.

394
35:58.320 --> 35:59.480
You don't have to visit.

395
36:04.840 --> 36:06.440
You have to come live with us.

396
36:15.040 --> 36:16.440
I forgive you.

397
36:19.080 --> 36:20.040
Please, Dad.

398
36:21.040 --> 36:22.560
Come live with us, Dad.

399
36:24.160 --> 36:25.400
Please, Dad.

400
36:26.080 --> 36:28.160
-Dad! No. -Anon!

401
36:28.880 --> 36:31.760
Anon! Anon!

402
36:32.360 --> 36:33.280
Dad.

403
36:34.400 --> 36:35.800
Come live with us.

404
36:42.080 --> 36:43.920
‎Come live with us.

405
37:48.240 --> 37:49.520
It was exactly like you said.

406
37:53.360 --> 37:55.240
By the time I forgave my father…

407
38:01.840 --> 38:03.280
it was too late.

408
38:10.720 --> 38:13.040
It's never too late for love.

409
38:16.200 --> 38:19.960
You may feel like you lost him.

410
38:22.640 --> 38:23.720
Well, you did.

411
38:26.720 --> 38:28.880
But what matters most is that

412
38:29.800 --> 38:30.760
you forgave him…

413
38:32.600 --> 38:34.720
accepted him…

414
38:36.520 --> 38:38.720
and truly loved him.

415
38:43.480 --> 38:47.560
I believe that wherever your father's spirit has gone…

416
38:49.360 --> 38:51.320
he's at peace…

417
38:53.560 --> 38:55.880
because he knew how much you loved him.

418
39:02.440 --> 39:04.920
When I lost Grandma…

419
39:10.320 --> 39:12.440
you told me to keep living…

420
39:15.240 --> 39:16.760
for the people I love.

421
39:22.160 --> 39:24.880
I want to tell you the same thing now.

422
39:30.400 --> 39:32.040
Keep going…

423
39:34.520 --> 39:36.040
for your mother.

424
40:14.240 --> 40:15.840
Dad, have you heard about Ramil?

425
40:15.920 --> 40:17.840
What?

426
40:17.920 --> 40:21.400
Is he going to kill himself and follow his father? Throw himself into a fire

427
40:21.480 --> 40:23.200
and become one of the Pleiades?

428
40:25.320 --> 40:26.680
No, Dad.

429
40:29.400 --> 40:31.920
Ramil inherited everything from his father.

430
40:32.560 --> 40:34.560
-Hello, Mr. Ramil. -Hello.

431
40:34.640 --> 40:36.480
I'm Mr. Anon's lawyer.

432
40:36.560 --> 40:40.400
He left a will in this document.

433
40:44.640 --> 40:47.520
I'll handle the transfer

434
40:47.600 --> 40:49.280
of all his assets to you.

435
40:51.040 --> 40:52.000
Thank you.

436
41:03.320 --> 41:05.720
His father brought me ten million.

437
41:05.800 --> 41:08.760
What could he possibly have left? Debt?

438
41:09.840 --> 41:13.040
I checked. There's more.

439
41:20.960 --> 41:24.800
Dad bought a house in the development in my name.

440
41:26.720 --> 41:30.640
He also left me all his shares. They're worth over a hundred million.

441
41:31.160 --> 41:34.920
Plus land and other assets.

442
41:38.240 --> 41:40.240
His father left him everything.

443
41:41.520 --> 41:44.360
He practically never has to work another day in his life.

444
41:46.880 --> 41:47.920
That parasite.

445
41:49.160 --> 41:51.200
You think you're going to rise above me now?

446
41:57.120 --> 41:59.920
Now that you have everything,

447
42:00.440 --> 42:02.200
what are you going to do?

448
42:04.920 --> 42:06.840
While the house is being built…

449
42:09.080 --> 42:11.200
I'll find somewhere temporary for Mom to live.

450
42:12.560 --> 42:15.880
Your mom is at Saksit's house right now

451
42:15.960 --> 42:20.760
packing her things. We should hurry over and tell her the good news.

452
42:23.240 --> 42:24.080
Let's go.

453
42:30.560 --> 42:31.880
Why did you come back?

454
42:31.960 --> 42:35.400
You already left this house.

455
42:35.960 --> 42:38.240
So leave. Get out.

456
42:38.960 --> 42:40.520
I changed my mind. I'm not leaving.

457
42:42.720 --> 42:46.240
Your husband dies and now you've lost your mind?

458
42:46.960 --> 42:51.160
Anon was supposed to take me away. He's dead now. Where am I supposed to go?

459
42:51.240 --> 42:54.680
Why don't you go live with your son?

460
42:54.760 --> 42:56.360
His life is pretty comfortable now.

461
43:00.280 --> 43:01.200
Mom.

462
43:02.200 --> 43:03.080
Come with me.

463
43:03.880 --> 43:05.040
I'll take care of you.

464
43:06.640 --> 43:10.600
You're unemployed and already struggling. I don't want to become a burden.

465
43:11.840 --> 43:14.720
Uncle Anon left everything to Ramil.

466
43:17.040 --> 43:20.200
That's right, Mom. Dad bought me a house.

467
43:20.280 --> 43:22.240
He left me his shares in the company.

468
43:22.320 --> 43:24.480
The assets are worth more than a hundred million.

469
43:29.720 --> 43:33.280
From now on, we don't have to struggle anymore.

470
43:34.120 --> 43:36.320
We don't have to be anyone's parasites ever again.

471
43:37.640 --> 43:40.360
While we wait for the new house to be finished,

472
43:40.440 --> 43:42.560
I'll find you a nice place to stay.

473
43:43.360 --> 43:44.200
Come with me.

474
43:47.040 --> 43:48.640
I want to stay here.

475
43:52.800 --> 43:53.920
Why, Mom?

476
43:55.360 --> 43:56.320
Oh.

477
43:58.760 --> 44:00.280
Did they threaten you again?

478
44:00.360 --> 44:04.520
Hey. Don't blame me.

479
44:05.720 --> 44:07.600
Go, sweetheart. I want to stay here.

480
44:07.680 --> 44:09.120
I don't understand.

481
44:09.640 --> 44:11.080
What happened?

482
44:11.160 --> 44:14.160
I have money now. I can take care of you.

483
44:14.240 --> 44:15.400
Come with me, Mom.

484
44:18.000 --> 44:19.640
I've been thinking about it.

485
44:20.440 --> 44:23.960
Mr. Saksit looked after me. He gave me food and a place to live.

486
44:24.560 --> 44:26.880
Now that we have money, walking away from him

487
44:26.960 --> 44:28.520
would feel too selfish.

488
44:28.600 --> 44:31.520
Mom, stop thinking like that.

489
44:31.600 --> 44:35.440
You've already repaid them far more than they ever did for us.

490
44:35.520 --> 44:39.720
No one in this house truly means well. They don't genuinely love anyone.

491
44:39.800 --> 44:41.680
All they care about is what they can get.

492
44:41.760 --> 44:43.480
Ramil, shut up.

493
44:44.000 --> 44:47.320
You barge into my house and insult us? Get out.

494
44:47.400 --> 44:49.720
I'll leave when my mom leaves.

495
44:49.800 --> 44:51.160
Then go with him.

496
44:53.240 --> 44:54.840
Maybe he'll finally stop barking.

497
44:55.960 --> 44:57.760
I'm staying here.

498
44:57.840 --> 44:59.000
Dad.

499
45:00.120 --> 45:01.720
Throw them out.

500
45:02.320 --> 45:04.760
You don't like pets that won't obey, do you?

501
45:07.440 --> 45:08.800
That's right, son.

502
45:09.880 --> 45:12.480
I enjoy training stubborn animals.

503
45:17.360 --> 45:19.400
I like breaking them until they obey.

504
45:26.840 --> 45:30.760
I'll allow you to stay in this house.

505
45:32.240 --> 45:35.080
Mom. You're coming with me right now.

506
45:38.440 --> 45:40.400
Go. I'm staying here.

507
45:42.760 --> 45:44.000
I don't understand.

508
45:44.760 --> 45:47.440
Before, you wanted to leave with me.

509
45:47.960 --> 45:49.240
And now,

510
45:50.200 --> 45:52.040
you want to put the collar back on?

511
45:54.760 --> 45:56.560
You want to be their pet that badly?

512
46:04.240 --> 46:05.880
Get out. Now.

513
46:13.320 --> 46:14.240
Fine.

514
46:17.040 --> 46:17.960
I'll go.

515
46:21.280 --> 46:22.960
This is the worst day of my life, Mom.

516
46:26.080 --> 46:27.600
I already lost Dad.

517
46:31.160 --> 46:32.960
Do I have to lose you too?

518
47:02.920 --> 47:05.240
Ramil, let me out here.

519
47:07.320 --> 47:08.320
Where are you going?

520
47:08.960 --> 47:12.040
I need to take care of something. I'll be back soon.

521
47:48.000 --> 47:50.400
I don't have much time. What is it?

522
47:51.400 --> 47:55.120
What are you planning? Why didn't you leave with Ramil?

523
47:57.600 --> 47:59.080
I already explained everything.

524
47:59.160 --> 48:01.280
If that's all you wanted to ask, I have to go.

525
48:01.360 --> 48:02.600
Auntie.

526
48:03.560 --> 48:05.080
I don't believe you.

527
48:05.160 --> 48:08.360
Someone who loves her son as much as you wouldn't do this.

528
48:09.720 --> 48:13.480
What are you planning? Please tell me.

529
48:13.560 --> 48:14.520
I want to help.

530
48:17.160 --> 48:19.720
I think they were involved in Anon's death.

531
48:23.000 --> 48:26.640
I've lived with them for a long time. I know when something is wrong.

532
48:27.440 --> 48:30.880
Even the story about meeting Anon at the lawyer's house.

533
48:32.960 --> 48:37.040
And now that I know how hard Anon worked for me and our son,

534
48:38.120 --> 48:40.160
I have to get justice for him.

535
48:41.880 --> 48:45.080
I think you should tell Ramil.

536
48:45.160 --> 48:46.880
Then he won't misunderstand you.

537
48:48.040 --> 48:51.600
No. Ramil cannot know. He has a hot temper.

538
48:52.520 --> 48:55.920
If he starts suspecting Saksit was involved in Anon's death,

539
48:56.000 --> 48:57.520
he won't stay quiet.

540
48:58.640 --> 49:00.920
That's exactly why I have to stay close to Saksit.

541
49:01.000 --> 49:03.120
I need to investigate everything myself.

542
49:04.800 --> 49:09.040
Promise me you won't tell anyone. This has to stay between us.

543
49:10.840 --> 49:13.200
I'll help you however I can.

544
49:13.280 --> 49:16.480
If you need anything, tell me.

545
49:16.560 --> 49:19.400
Do not do this alone. It's too dangerous.

546
49:22.560 --> 49:23.800
I have to go.

547
49:25.120 --> 49:26.440
Take care of Ramil for me.

548
49:27.040 --> 49:27.920
I will.

549
49:39.760 --> 49:42.720
I'm glad your father is dead.

550
49:42.800 --> 49:45.240
NEXT EPISODE

551
49:45.320 --> 49:48.160
We need to finish the work so Grandpa will be happy.

552
49:49.880 --> 49:53.360
You'll see that this granddaughter you love

553
49:53.880 --> 49:57.160
is a hundred, a thousand times better than that parasite.

554
49:57.240 --> 50:00.120
I'd like Nuchwara and her son to stay here.

555
50:00.200 --> 50:02.280
Why do you care so much and treat her so well

556
50:02.360 --> 50:04.160
when she's just Ramil's wife?

557
50:04.240 --> 50:06.160
And what if I'm more than that?

558
52:02.000 --> 52:04.000
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen

559
52:04.000 --> 52:05.000
